GsuVhnASvzmXXwYfFVlKaicYJibIiaQiclEDqZ9NndOhcQER1Rnq7VDZlu5rvzLs5iaJ1n47J2eibO3bQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>党建好案例</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>兽医药理学团队教工党支部</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibGsuVhnASvzmXXwYfFVlKaicYJibIiaQiclEDqZ9NndOhcQER1Rnq7VDZlu5rvzLs5iaJ1n47J2eibO3bQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><b></b></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibGsuVhnASvzmXXwYfFVlKaOLO7HVAYp83AC9nRZvibhMwLXSZIT3OKzWmW022J6Jl6o8SjbWKlo7A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>兽医药理学团队教工党支部</span></span></p><p><span><span>与学生支部联学共建</span></span></p><p><span><span>兽医药理学团队教工党支部充分发挥全国高校</span></span><span><span>“双带头人”教师党支部工作室示范引领作用，着力打造党建“红色引擎”，引领师生深耕兽药研发前沿、深化产教融合，以高水平科技自立自强培育兽药领域新质生产力，争当行业高质量发展先锋。</span></span></p><p><span><span>支部先后入选广东省高校</span></span><span><span>“党建工作样板支部”、广东省高校“双带头人”教师党支部书记工作室，获评教育部第三批高校“双带头人”教师党支部书记工作室培育项目及“强国行”专项团队，并获得全省高校基层党建工作创新案例二等奖</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>项。</span></span></p><p><span><span>支部团队成功构建移动化耐药监测新平台，破解了替加环素耐药新基因的传播与进化难题，指明了新药研发方向；揭示了环境驱动耐药基因传播的生态规律，奠定了</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>One Health</span></span><span><span>”大健康产业的科学基础；构建了“源头</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>过程</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>终端”全链条防控新体系，为我国抗菌药耐药性综合治理与抗生素安全用药提供了关键技术支撑与系统解决方案。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibGsuVhnASvzmXXwYfFVlKaicYJibIiaQiclEDqZ9NndOhcQER1Rnq7VDZlu5rvzLs5iaJ1n47J2eibO3bQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>书记好党课</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>林木遗传育种教研室教工党支部</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibGsuVhnASvzmXXwYfFVlKaicYJibIiaQiclEDqZ9NndOhcQER1Rnq7VDZlu5rvzLs5iaJ1n47J2eibO3bQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><b></b></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibGsuVhnASvzmXXwYfFVlKa8x0IpUvk3vpGEaA8Ph4cMkQUSVuUZdHV7O7g9hzI7awFoCvE3OVVNA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>林木遗传育种教研室教工党支部书记</span></span><span><span>李培</span></span></p><p><span><span>本党课由</span></span><span><span>林木遗传育种教研室教工党支部书记</span></span><span><span>李培担任主讲，</span></span><span><span>李培、叶晓燕两位老师共同创作</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>党课</span></span><span><span>以</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>一场跨越百年的绿色接力：以青春之我，绘绿美新卷！</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>为主题，回望沈鹏飞教授弃笔从戎、垦荒白云山的红色初心</span></span><span><span>，凝练</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>把个人理想写进国家年轮</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>的红色基因</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>聚焦当下，</span></span><span><span>展现</span></span><span><span>学院党委以高质量党建引领绿色事业高质量发展，牵头组建</span></span><span><span>“1+6+N”</span></span><span><span>工作专班，组成技术团队为全省</span></span><span><span>21</span></span><span><span>个地市提供技术指导</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>打造了多个绿美广东示范样板</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>开设的</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>绿美广东专项创新班</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>等亮点，诠释</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>党旗飘在</span></span><span><span>林海间</span></span><span><span>、论文写在大地上</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>的林风担当；面向未来，</span></span><span><span>号召党员教师把科研扎根一线、青年学子把课堂搬进乡村、党支部把堡垒筑在生产一线</span></span><span><span>，以</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>多一次绿化、多一项课题</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>的实际行动接好绿色接力棒，让红色血脉与绿色使命在岭南大地持续奔涌，为绿美广东贡献林风智慧与华农力量。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibGsuVhnASvzmXXwYfFVlKaicYJibIiaQiclEDqZ9NndOhcQER1Rnq7VDZlu5rvzLs5iaJ1n47J2eibO3bQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>党员好榜样</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>工程学院罗锡文院士</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibGsuVhnASvzmXXwYfFVlKaicYJibIiaQiclEDqZ9NndOhcQER1Rnq7VDZlu5rvzLs5iaJ1n47J2eibO3bQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibGsuVhnASvzmXXwYfFVlKaGzRmicoDdiavKbcNKS3rGMibwFKWTmLPevs4eOM8IUEIpDOHaTI9UEWhw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>罗锡文院士（中）在无人农场指导生产</span></span></p><p><span><span>罗锡文院士潜心农业机械化科学研究</span></span><span><span>55</span></span><span><span>年，首创水稻精量穴直播技术与机具，获国家技术发明奖二等奖；创新研发基于北斗的农业机械自动导航作业关键技术，获国家科技进步奖二等奖；创建了全球首个水稻无人农场，引领我国智慧农业发展。</span></span></p><p><span><span>他深耕农业工程教学</span></span><span><span>43</span></span><span><span>年，获国家教学成果二等奖</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>项，广东省教育教学成果一等奖</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>项、二等奖</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>项；主编教材与专著</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>部，其中《农业机械化生产学（下册）》获首届全国教材建设奖二等奖；牵头建设的农业工程教师团队入选第二批全国高校黄大年式教师团队。他以《与共和国农机事业共成长》为题，每年为新生讲授入学第一课，引导学生树立“学农、爱农、事农”的专业思想。</span></span><span><span>2024</span></span><span><span>年，他发起成立“强农”教育基金，个人捐资</span></span><span><span>300</span></span><span><span>万元，并募集资金累计超过</span></span><span><span>650</span></span><span><span>万元，用于奖励优秀学生、支持青年教师和改善教学科研条件。</span></span></p><p><span><span>华农将坚持党建领航</span></span></p><p><span><span>总结推广好</span></span></p><p><span><span>“党建好案例、书记好党课、党员好榜样”</span></span></p><p><span><span>先进经验</span></span></p><p><span><span>引导全体师生筑牢信仰根基</span></span></p><p><span><span>厚植家国情怀、勇担时代使命</span></span></p><p><span><span>在新征程上奋力书写</span></span></p><p><span><span>服务国家战略</span></span></p><p><span><span>支撑广东高质量发展的华农篇章</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9JuUicTWpVBjeicaTwSpcuT2D9t7FHbR28IRD3dsKbUZ6ibUstejIJqMmMw8dU2UnLiavnph3RddxcSw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>往期回顾</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652872419&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=7c536f1707ad95fcdac8744561397391&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcibGsuVhnASvzmXXwYfFVlKadnLxlGBpmhPy3AnXNZGWf2nDNkhz7Ez5az1YOibxGOc9O12tCqkD0Vw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/ </span></strong></span><span>华农2026年寒假服务指南汇总</span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652872389&a